{
  "name": "SEO Blog Writer Agent - Printyx Supabase",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Setup Guide for Printyx Self-Hosted Supabase\n\n## Prerequisites\n1. Self-hosted Supabase in Coolify\n2. N8N running in Coolify\n3. Direct API keys (no OpenRouter needed)\n\n## Required Environment Variables\n\n### Supabase (Printyx-specific naming)\n- `PRINTYX_SUPABASE_URL` - Your Supabase API URL (e.g., https://api.printyx.net)\n- `PRINTYX_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` - Service role key for admin operations\n\n### AI Services (Direct API Access)\n- `OPENAI_API_KEY` - OpenAI API key for GPT models\n- `CLAUDE_API_KEY` - Anthropic API key for Claude models\n- `PERPLEXITY_API_KEY` - Perplexity API key for research\n\n## Database Tables Required\n- `blog_content_queue` - Pending blog requests\n- `blog_posts` - Published blog content\n\n## Storage Bucket Required\n- `blog-images` bucket in Supabase Storage\n\n## Model Usage\n- GPT-4o-mini: SERP analysis, SEO metadata\n- Claude 3.5 Haiku: Title, takeaways, outline, humanizing\n- Claude 3.5 Sonnet: Main content writing",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "setup-guide",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [0, 0],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 1. Fetch Pending Blog Requests from Supabase",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "section-1-note",
      "name": "Section 1: Queue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [560, 0],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [600, 120],
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.PRINTYX_SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/blog_content_queue",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "status",
              "value": "eq.pending"
            },
            {
              "name": "select",
              "value": "*"
            },
            {
              "name": "order",
              "value": "priority.desc,created_at.asc"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "5"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $env.PRINTYX_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.PRINTYX_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Prefer",
              "value": "return=representation"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "get-pending-posts",
      "name": "Get Pending Posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [820, 120],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "loop-posts",
      "name": "Loop Over Posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "position": [1040, 120],
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "queue-id",
              "name": "queue_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
